      <p>
        {t(
          lang,
          "否则它就是一个「在主线程里思考」的技能——用一段聚焦的提示词，在它已经握着的脊柱上工作。隔离本身没有价值，隔离要买到东西才做。",
          "Otherwise it's an in-thread skill: the agent thinking with a focused prompt over the spine it already holds. Isolation isn't a virtue in itself. You isolate when isolation buys something.",
        )}
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-2 rv" style="margin-top:24px">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="cardic a"><Icon name="book" /></div>
