        <p>{t(lang, "进去的是项目范围、为什么读这一篇、提案快照；隔离处理的是全文与阅读牌组；回来的是五个字段：发现、可信度判断、关键引句、新线索、对提案的影响。文章正文和阅读对话，从未进过主线程。", "In: the project scope, why this source, a proposal snapshot. Isolated on: the full text and the reading deck. Out: five fields — findings, credibility, key quotes, new leads, impact on the proposal. The article body and the reading dialogue never touched the main thread.")}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="cardic g"><Icon name="gauge" /></div>
        <h3>{t(lang, "评估子代理 · 旗舰档，永不降级", "Assessment sub-agent · flagship, never downgraded")}</h3>
        <p>{t(lang, "陪练可以走中档模型，可以降级；评估不行。它吞下整段过程——脊柱、折叠后的历史、每张卡的结果——吐回双轴读数与一段叙述。成本上它是最贵的一次调用，也是唯一不允许省的一次。", "The coach can run mid-tier and can be downgraded. The assessment cannot. It swallows the whole process — spine, folded history, every card outcome — and returns the two-axis reading plus prose. It's the most expensive call we make, and the only one we never economise on.")}</p>
