        "折叠是事件驱动的：提案定稿、阅读子代理返回、计划生成、一张卡完成——一旦定形就折进脊柱，那些原始轮次随即离开窗口。只有当窗口仍然超预算时，才把最早的对话折成摘要。绝不按时间折，时间是错误的轴。",
        "Folding is event-driven: a proposal finalised, a reading sub-agent returning, a plan generated, a card completed. The moment something solidifies it folds into the spine and those raw turns leave the window. Only if the window still exceeds budget do the oldest turns become a digest. Never on a timer — time is the wrong axis.",
      )}
