<!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════ RECORD LAYER ══════ -->
<section class="section" id="record">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head rv">
      <div class="eyebrow"><span class="pip"></span>{t(lang, "L4 · 记录层", "L4 · the record layer")}</div>
      <h2 class="sec-title">{t(lang, "过程要能回查，先得被记成结构", "For a process to be checkable, it has to be recorded as structure")}</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        {t(
          lang,
          "聊天记录算不上证据。证据是能被指认、能被回放、能被点开的那种东西。所以每一次交互都落成一条有类型的记录，一行文本日志做不到这件事。评估层后来能做到「每句判断都指得回去」，靠的全是这一层。",
          "A chat log isn't evidence. Evidence is something that can be pointed at, replayed and opened. So every interaction lands as a typed record rather than a line of text log. Everything the evaluation layer can later claim rests on this one.",
        )}
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="tablewrap rv" style="margin-top:44px">
      <table class="dt">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th style="width:170px">{t(lang, "发生了什么", "What happened")}</th>
            <th>{t(lang, "记成什么结构", "What gets stored")}</th>
            <th>{t(lang, "它后来支撑了什么", "What it later supports")}</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {records.map(([az, ae, bz, be, cz, ce]) => (
            <tr>
              <td class="k">{t(lang, az, ae)}</td>
              <td>{t(lang, bz, be)}</td>
              <td>{t(lang, cz, ce)}</td>
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-2 rv" style="margin-top:32px">
      <div class="callout">
        <div class="cl"><Icon name="branch" />{t(lang, "过程树是投影出来的", "The process tree is a projection")}</div>
        <h3>{t(lang, "没有单独的过程树表", "There is no process-tree table")}</h3>
        <p>
          {t(
            lang,
            "节点之间的父子关系由 parent_node_id 表达，树是查询时投影出来的。少一张表，就少一处会和事实不一致的地方。",
            "Parent–child relations are carried by parent_node_id, and the tree is projected at query time. One table fewer is one fewer place that can disagree with the facts.",
          )}
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="callout">
        <div class="cl"><Icon name="slash" />{t(lang, "跳过也被记下来", "Skipping is recorded too")}</div>
        <h3>{t(lang, "摩擦被转成信号，不被消灭", "Friction becomes signal, and is not removed")}</h3>
        <p>
          {t(
            lang,
            "学生跳过一张卡、让 AI 直接答，一样落一条记录。一个只测量、不干预的系统，测得越准，也只是更准确地记录一个学生如何变得被动。",
            "A student who skips a card and asks the AI to just answer leaves a record all the same. A system that only measures and never intervenes just documents, with increasing accuracy, how a student became passive.",
          )}
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══════════════════════════════════ EVALUATION · PIPELINE ════ -->
<section class="section band-cool" id="evaluation">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head rv">
      <div class="eyebrow"><span class="pip"></span>{t(lang, "L5 · 评估层", "L5 · the evaluation layer")}</div>
      <h2 class="sec-title">{t(lang, "事实用数的，判断用证据拴住", "The facts are counted. The judgments are tethered.")}</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        {t(
          lang,
          "报告生成分成两个半区。事实半区永远不需要模型：轮次、材料数、字数、批注、修订、里程碑、时间线，全部从记录里直接算。模型半区只做判断，而且只能引用一个预先建好的候选证据集里的东西——指不到的引用，生成完直接丢弃。",
          "Report generation splits in two. The fact half never needs a model: turns, materials, words, comments, revisions, milestones and timeline all compute straight from the record. The model half only makes judgments — and may only cite from a pre-built index of candidates. Citations that don't resolve are dropped after generation.",
        )}
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="stage rv-pop" style="margin-top:48px">
      <div class="stage-bar">
        <span class="dots"><b></b><b></b><b></b></span>
        <span class="t">assembleFacts · 4 flagship calls · ValidateRefs</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stage-body">
        <div class="dhint">{t(lang, "← 左右滑动查看完整图 →", "← swipe to pan the diagram →")}</div>
        <div class="dscroll"><EvalPipeline /></div>
        <div class="legend">
          <span><i class="p"></i>{t(lang, "确定性事实", "deterministic facts")}</span>
          <span><i class="a"></i>{t(lang, "证据候选集", "evidence candidates")}</span>
          <span><i class="g"></i>{t(lang, "旗舰模型调用", "flagship model calls")}</span>
          <span><i></i>{t(lang, "组装与校验", "assembly & validation")}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-3" style="margin-top:48px">
      <div class="card rv" style="--i:0">
        <div class="cardic"><Icon name="bolt" /></div>
        <h3>{t(lang, "三路并发，一路等待", "Three run together, one waits")}</h3>
        <p>{t(lang, "提示词观测、风险行为、双轴判层互不依赖，同时发出；只有叙述那一路要等判层的结果，因为它要把双轴写成一段人话。", "Prompt lens, risk signals and the two-axis rubric are independent and fire together. Only the narrative waits — it has to turn the axis result into readable prose.")}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card rv" style="--i:1">
        <div class="cardic a"><Icon name="link" /></div>
        <h3>{t(lang, "引用必须回指得到", "A citation has to land")}</h3>
        <p>{t(lang, "模型能引用的东西被限定在一个索引里：某一条消息、某一次事件、某一张卡、某一个来源。生成之后逐条回指校验，指不到的整条丢弃，并记录丢弃率。", "What the model may cite is bounded by an index: a message, an event, a card, a source. Afterwards every citation is re-checked; unresolvable ones are dropped whole, and the drop rate is recorded.")}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card rv" style="--i:2">
        <div class="cardic g"><Icon name="shield" /></div>
        <h3>{t(lang, "坏掉一路，不会坏掉整份", "One call failing doesn't fail the report")}</h3>
        <p>{t(lang, "某一路调用失败或缺席，只让那一节退化成空或保守下限，整份报告照常生成。事实半区在任何情况下都还在。", "A failed or absent call degrades that section to empty or a conservative floor rather than sinking the whole report. The fact half survives regardless.")}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tablewrap rv" style="margin-top:48px">
      <table class="dt">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th style="width:190px">{t(lang, "调用", "Call")}</th>
            <th>{t(lang, "档位与理由", "Tier, and why")}</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td class="k">{t(lang, "陪练对话", "The coach")}</td>
            <td>{t(lang, "中档模型，允许降级。一次只问一个问题，本来就不需要长篇输出——降级不影响教学质量。", "Mid-tier, downgradable. It asks one question at a time and never needs long output, so a downgrade costs no teaching quality.")}</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="k">{t(lang, "阅读子代理", "Reading sub-agent")}</td>
            <td>{t(lang, "隔离处理长文本，返回结构化要点；上下文大，输出小。", "Isolated over long text, returns structured takeaways. Big context in, small payload out.")}</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="k">{t(lang, "评估四路", "The four evaluation calls")}</td>
            <td>{t(lang, "旗舰档，永不降级。这是唯一会被学生、家长、教师反复读的输出，也是唯一可能影响到人的判断。", "Flagship, never downgraded. It's the one output students, parents and teachers read repeatedly — and the one that could affect a person.")}</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="k">{t(lang, "每一次真实调用", "Every real call")}</td>
            <td>{t(lang, "都记一行：档位、输入输出 token、成本。组织层的成本汇总由此而来——用了多少，一目了然。", "Logs a row: tier, input and output tokens, cost. Organisation-level cost rollups come from exactly this — what was spent is never a mystery.")}</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

